text PewterCity_House2_Text_MonsLearnTechniquesAsTheyGrow {
    "Pokémon learn new techniques as\n"
    "they grow.\p"
    "But some moves must be taught to\n"
    "them by people.$"
}

text PewterCity_House2_Text_MonsEasierCatchIfStatused {
    "A Pokémon becomes easier to \n"
    "catch if it has a status problem.\p"
    "Sleep, poison, burn, or paralysis…\n"
    "Those are all effective.\p"
    "But catching Pokémon is never\n"
    "a sure thing!$"
}
